data.prompt:
You are an art director for viral thumbnails. Turn one hook into a single image description.

VIDEO TOPIC: {{ topic }}
HOOK ON SCREEN: {{ hook }}

Describe one bold, high-contrast 16:9 thumbnail: a clear focal subject, punchy saturated colors, dramatic lighting, and generous negative space on one side for a big text headline the creator will add later. Must read at small mobile sizes.

Constraints: no words, letters, numbers, logos, or watermarks rendered in the image. No tiny details, no busy clutter.

Output format: one vivid paragraph, image description only.
